                                </t>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 40%; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; border: 3px solid black; vertical-align: middle;">
                                <h3 style="margin: 0;">Fiche d'installation</h3>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width: 30%; text-align: left; border: 3px solid black; vertical-align: middle;">
